# json.dict - afl-fuzz -x dictionary for the Cpanel::JSON::XS harness.
#
# AFL++'s dictionaries/json.dict, then what Cpanel::JSON::XS adds to JSON:
# relaxed syntax (bare keys, single quotes, comments, duplicate keys),
# (tag)[...] values, the fixture classes and filter keys (fixture.pl), number
# and bignum edge cases, inf/nan spellings, BOMs, and the encodings its UTF-8
# paths branch on.

